// SP14 (compiler/egraph.fd, native paths; FID_NAT_OFF=egraph turns it off):
// the e-graph's budgets (EG_GROW_PER_SEED, EG_WORK_PER_SEED: nodes and work
// in proportion to a function's size) and the indexes that keep a round
// linear (a class's constant read from its root, the unary nodes and the
// additions kept in lists). Two long functions of rewritable arithmetic
// (wrapping: reassociation, x * 4 as a shift, -(-x); checked: identities,
// !!b), a constant found through a union, and float identities. Every line
// must be what the program computes with the e-graph off; with
// FID_EGRAPH_STATS=1 the build prints the e-graph's counters
// (scripts/egraph-budget-check.sh).
//
// Expected output:
// 11364
// 6480
// 15
// 29
// 9
// 3

@wrapping
fn chain_wrapping(x: i64, y: i64) -> i64 {
